b. institutionalization of gender mainstreaming within the Regional Government;
c. empowerment of Women in the political, legal, economic, cultural and social fields in community organizations at the district level;
d. strengthening and development of institutions providing Women's empowerment services at the district level;
e. implementing Prevention efforts against the occurrence of Violence against Women.
